  unitName: Handsome Prince Mordred (EU)
  unitId: 740167
  unitNumber: 7238
  description: "The illegitimate son of King Arthur, this young man and his father
    ended up facing off in a deadly duel. A mysterious sorcerer and a talented engineer
    managed to alter this disastrous fate with the power of the Grail. If Mordred
    would\u2019ve been brought up as a legitimate prince, he could\u2019ve been a
    lazy and idle boy. Being naturally skilled with the sword, he could have been
    less diligent with his training sessions, much to the displeasure of his instructor,
    the knight Perceval. Rather, he might have taken advantage of these hours in
    order to go seduce the court. Many women might fight in order to obtain his favor,
    but only a few gentlemen might\u2019ve approached the charming prince, one of
    which being Lancelot. Enjoying parties, he could have spent a fortune in order
    to organize these grand banquets with his friends. The king might remain nevertheless
    blind to his beloved son\u2019s escapades and he could\u2019ve even gone all
    the way to offering him the legendary sword, Excalibur, for his coming of age.
    However, the prince couldn\u2019t win unanimous support amongst the Knights of
    the Round Table. In fact, he might laugh at the famous quest for the fanciful
    goblet. While he might be an invincible warrior, could the kingdom be safe with
    a successor who is not very responsible?"
  summonDesc: 
  fusionDesc: "Father! My friends! Let\u2019s celebrate after the battle!"
  evoDesc: So handsome and strong... This is the invincible Prince Mordred!
